<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Production - Unveil the Magic Behind Zero-Click Deployment</title>
	<style>
			body {
				font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				background: #f5f7fa;
				color: #23272a;
				min-height: 100vh;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: flex-start;
			}

			.head-image {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: center;
				margin-top: 48px;
				margin-bottom: 32px;
			}

			.head-image img {
				border-radius: 8px;
				box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
			}

			.content {
				max-width: 600px;
				background: #fff;
				padding: 32px 24px;
				border-radius: 12px;
				box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
				text-align: center;
			}

			a {
				color: #0077cc;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: color 0.2s;
			}

			a:hover {
				text-decoration: underline;
				color: #005fa3;
			}

			@media (max-width: 600px) {
				.head-image img {
					max-width: 90vw;
					height: auto;
				}
				.content {
					background: #fff;
				}
			}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="head-image">
		<img src="/img/headimage.jpg" alt="Head Image" style="border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);">
	</div>
	<div class="content">
		<h1>👋 Hello, nice to meet you!</h1>
		<p>I’m a freelance developer passionate about building elegant, efficient solutions. This site is intentionally minimal—just what you need, nothing you don’t.</p>
		<p>What you’re seeing here is the result of a <span style="color:#4fc3f7;font-weight:bold;">automated, zero-click Continuous Deployment pipeline</span>, powered by <b>Eleventy</b>.</p>
		<p style="margin-top:2em;">Curious about the magic behind this seamless workflow?<br>
		<span style="font-weight:600;">Learn more:</span></p>
		<p><a href="https://medium.com/@kinneko-de/d5e22b061008" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>✨ Unveil the Magic Behind Zero-Click Deployment &rarr;</b></a></p>
		<p style="font-size:0.95em;color:#b0b0b0;margin-top:2em;">Thanks for stopping by. If you’d like to connect or have a project in mind, feel free to reach out!</p>
	</div>
</body>
</html>